span>&gt;</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><a class=\"hover:underline transition-colors\" href=\"/publications\">Publications</a></div></nav><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4\"><span class=\"w-8 h-0.5 bg-amber-500\"></span><span class=\"text-amber-400 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase\">PUBLICATION CATALOGUE</span></div><h1 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-serif font-light text-white leading-tight max-w-3xl mb-6 drop-shadow-sm\">A Digital Library of Qur&#x27;anic Scholarship</h1><p class=\"text-slate-200 text-sm sm:text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-2xl font-light mb-8 drop-shadow-sm\">Peer-reviewed journals, books, monographs, proceedings and digital collections published by the Institute and its international collaborators.</p><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-600 text-white text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium px-6 py-3.5 rounded-full transition shadow-lg\" href=\"/submit-research\"><span>Submit Your Research</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section class=\"py-16 bg-[#f8f6f0] border-y border-amber-200/50\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6\"><div class=\"mb-12\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><span class=\"w-6 h-0.5 bg-emerald-700\"></span><span class=\"text-emerald-800 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase\">FEATURED</span></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif text-slate-800 mb-2\">Highlights from the Catalogue</h2><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base\">Selected works representing the Institute&#x27;s current research priorities.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-