hadow-xs\"><span class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 bg-slate-900/80 text-white text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase px-3 py-1 rounded-md z-10 backdrop-blur-sm\">RESEARCH PAPERS</span><div class=\"relative w-4/5 h-4/5 rounded shadow-lg overflow-hidden group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\"><img alt=\"Arabic Language Technologies\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-paper-1.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-paper-1.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-paper-1.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-paper-1.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-paper-1.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-paper-1.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-paper-1.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-paper-1.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-paper-1.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-serif font-medium text-slate-800 mb-1 leading-snug group-hover:text-emerald-800 transition-colors\">Arabic Language Technologies</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 mb-3\">Prof. Muhammad Rashid AK</p><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4 line-clamp-3\">AI-powered tools for Arabic natural language processing, automated translation and linguistic analysis supporting Islamic scholarship.</p></div><div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-slate-200/80 text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-wider text-slate-500 uppercase flex items-center gap-2\"><span>2026</span><span>·</span><span>42 PP.</span><span>·</span><span>ENGLISH</span></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col justify-between group cursor-pointer bg-white p-5 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/80 shadow-2xs hover:shadow-md transition\"><div><div class=\"relative w-full aspect-3/4 rounded-2xl bg-[#f5f2eb] border border-slate-200/80 p-6 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 overflow-hidden shadow-xs\"><span class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 bg-slate-900/80 text-white text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase px-3 py-1 rounded-md z-10 backdrop-blur-sm\">BOOKS</span><div class=\"relative w-4/5 h-4/5 rounded shadow-lg overflow-hidden group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\"><img alt=\"Qur&#x27;anic Linguistics and Rhetorical Structure\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-book-2.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-book-2.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-book-2.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-book-2.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-book-2.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-book-2.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-book-2.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-book-2.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-book-2.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-serif font-medium text-slate-800 mb-1 leading-snug group-hover:text-emerald-800 transition-colors\">Qur&#x27;anic Linguistics and Rhetorical Structure</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 mb-3\">Department of Qur&#x27;anic Linguistics</p><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4 line-clamp-3\">The linguistic structure, rhetoric and stylistic features of the Holy Qur&#x27;an examined through classical and computational methods.</p></div><div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-slate-200/80 text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-wider text-slate-500 uppercase flex items-center gap-2\"><span>2025</span><span>·</span><span>266 PP.</span><span>·</span><span>ARABIC</span></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col justify-between group cursor-pointer bg-white p-5 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/80 shadow-2xs hover:shadow-md transition\"><div><div class=\"relative w-full aspect-3/4 rounded-2xl bg-[#f5f2eb] border border-slate-200/80 p-6 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 overflow-hidden shadow-xs\"><span class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 bg-slate-900/80 text-white text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase px-3 py-1 rounded-md z-10 backdrop-blur-sm\">PROCEEDINGS</span><div class=\"relative w-4/5 h-4/5 rounded shadow-lg overflow-hidden group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\"><img alt=\"Proceedings: Knowledge, Faith &amp; Civilization\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-proceedings-1.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-proceedings-1.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-proceedings-1.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-proceedings-1.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-proceedings-1.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-proceedings-1.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-proceedings-1.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-proceedings-1.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-proceedings-1.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-serif font-medium text-slate-800 mb-1 leading-snug group-hover:text-emerald-800 transition-colors\">Proceedings: Knowledge, Faith &amp; Civilization</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 mb-3\">IRITAQ International Conference</p><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4 line-clamp-3\">Full proceedings of the international conference convening scholars from universities and research centres worldwide.</p></div><div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-slate-200/80 text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-wider text-slate-500 uppercase flex items-center gap-2\"><span>2026</span><span>·</span><span>402 PP.</span><span>·</span><span>ARABIC / ENGLISH</span></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col justify-between group cursor-pointer bg-white p-5 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/80 shadow-2xs hover:shadow-md transition\"><div><div class=\"relative w-full aspect-3/4 rounded-2xl bg-[#f5f2eb] border border-slate-200/80 p-6 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 overflow-hidden shadow-xs\"><span class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 bg-slate-900/80 text-white text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase px-3 py-1 rounded-md z-10 backdrop-blur-sm\">JOURNALS</span><div class=\"relative w-4/5 h-4/5 rounded shadow-lg overflow-hidden group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\"><img alt=\"Review of Qur&#x27;anic Sciences\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-journal-2.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-journal-2.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-journal-2.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-journal-2.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-journal-2.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-journal-2.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-journal-2.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-journal-2.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-journal-2.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-serif font-medium text-slate-800 mb-1 leading-snug group-hover:text-emerald-800 transition-colors\">Review of Qur&#x27;anic Sciences</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 mb-3\">Editorial Board, IRITAQ</p><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4 line-clamp-3\">Peer-reviewed studies in Ulum al-Qur&#x27;an, revelation history and the textual sciences of the Holy Qur&#x27;an.</p></div><div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-slate-200/80 text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-wider text-slate-500 uppercase flex items-center gap-2\"><span>2025</span><span>·</span><span>196 PP.</span><span>·</span><span>ENGLISH</span></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col justify-between group cursor-pointer bg-white p-5 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/80 shadow-2xs hover:shadow-md transition\"><div><div class=\"relative w-full aspect-3/4 rounded-2xl bg-[#f5f2eb] border border-slate-200/80 p-6 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 overflow-hidden shadow-xs\"><span class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 bg-slate-900/80 text-white text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase px-3 py-1 rounded-md z-10 backdrop-blur-sm\">MONOGRAPHS</span><div class=\"relative w-4/5 h-4/5 rounded shadow-lg overflow-hidden group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\"><img alt=\"Qira&#x27;at Transmission Chains: A Critical Survey\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-mono-2.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-mono-2.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-mono-2.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-mono-2.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-mono-2.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-mono-2.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-mono-2.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-mono-2.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpub-cover-mono-2.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-serif font-medium text-slate-800 mb-1 leading-snug group-hover:text-emerald-800 transition-colors\">Qira&#x27;at Transmission Chains: A Critical Survey</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 mb-3\">Dr. Yasir Sarhan al-Dib</p><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4 line-clamp-3\">The canonical readings, their transmission chains and the phonetic sciences of recitation examined in critical perspective.</p></div><div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-slate-200/80 text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-wider text-slate-500 uppercase flex items-center gap-2\"><span>2025</span><span>·</span><span>158 PP.</span><span>·</span><span>ARABIC</span></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-12 px-6 max-w-7xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"w-full bg-[#04402a] text-white rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 md:p-16 shadow-xl border border-emerald-900/50 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-8\"><div class=\"max-w-2xl\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-light text-white mb-4\">Submit your research to IRITAQ</h2><p class=\"text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed font-light\">The Institute welcomes original scholarly contributions in Tafsir, Qur&#x27;anic Sciences, Qira&#x27;at, manuscripts and digital humanities.</p></div><a class=\"bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium px-6 py-3.5 rounded-full inline-flex items-center gap-2 transition shadow-lg shrink-0\" href=\"/submit-research\"><span>Submit Your Research</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"w-full bg-[#111613] text-[#cfd4cf] font-sans border-t border-[#1e2520]\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-16 pt-16 pb-12\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-12 pb-14 border-b border-[#1e2520]\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-1 space-y-5\"><div class=\"relative w-36 h-14\"><img alt=\"IRITAQ Logo\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain brightness-0 invert\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Flogo-iritaq.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Flogo-iritaq.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Flogo-iritaq.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Flogo-iritaq.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Flogo-iritaq.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Flogo-iritaq.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Flogo-iritaq.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Flogo-iritaq.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Flogo-iritaq.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><h2 class=\"text-white font-serif font-light text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight\">International Research Institute for Tafsir Al-Qur&#x27;an</h2><p class=\"text-xs text-[#9da39d] font-light leading-relaxed\">Advancing authentic Qur&#x27;anic scholarship through research, publication and international collaboration.</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 pt-2\"><a href=\"https://facebook.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-white hover:bg-slate-200 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-950 transition shadow-xs\" aria-label=\"Facebook\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-950\">f</span></a><a href=\"https://linkedin.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-white hover:bg-slate-200 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-950 transition shadow-xs\" aria-label=\"LinkedIn\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-950\">in</span></a><a href=\"https://twitter.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-white hover:bg-slate-200 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-950 transition shadow-xs\" aria-label=\"Twitter / X\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-950\">𝕏</span></a><a href=\"https://youtube.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-white hover:bg-slate-200 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-950 transition shadow-xs\" aria-label=\"YouTube\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-950\">▶</span></a></div></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-serif font-medium tracking-wider text-[#d4af37] uppercase\">Institute</h4><ul class=\"space-y-3 text-xs font-light text-[#b0b8b0]\"><li><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/about\">About IRITAQ</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/governance\">Governance</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/academics/departments\">Academic Departments</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/international-partnerships\">International Partnerships</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-serif font-medium tracking-wider text-[#d4af37] uppercase\">Academics</h4><ul class=\"space-y-3 text-xs font-light text-[#b0b8b0]\"><li><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/research\">Research</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/academics/programs\">Aca